### Variabel Lingkungan Lokal
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### 1. Ambil Data Portofolio (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolio

### 2. Update Teks Hero (CMS)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/hero
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lead Gameplay Programmer & Backend Engineer",
  "description": "Fokus pada arsitektur data-driven Unity C# dan REST API performa tinggi."
}

### 3. Tambah Kartu Pengalaman Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/experiences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Unity Developer",
  "company": "Meraki Studio",
  "description": "Mengembangkan mekanik tower defense dan optimasi memori.",
  "start_date": "2024-01-01",
  "end_date": "2024-12-01"
}

### 4. Tambah Tag Skill Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SQLite",
  "category": "Database"
}

### 5. Hapus Tag Skill Berdasarkan ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/skills/1

### 6. Hapus Kartu Pengalaman Berdasarkan ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/experiences/1